      "value": "solved: the issue was with my router. i assume it was getting overloaded or something and dropping packets which vrc doesn't seem to like (i guess it just gives up early??). the solution was to reduce the target bandwidth in steam link (i was using 100mbps, 60mbps seems like its fine) and also set a bandwith limit for vrc.",
